# Accept an Afterpay or Clearpay payment

Learn how to accept Afterpay (also known as Clearpay in the UK), a payment method in the US, CA, UK, AU, and NZ.

## Index

This article has multiple variants. Fetch one of the following URLs to view specific content for your use case:

- [Checkout](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/afterpay-clearpay/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=checkout)
- Elements:
  - [Checkout Sessions API](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/afterpay-clearpay/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=elements&api-integration=checkout)
  - [Payment Intents API](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/afterpay-clearpay/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=elements&api-integration=paymentintents)
- [Direct API](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/afterpay-clearpay/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=direct-api)
- Mobile:
  - [iOS](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/afterpay-clearpay/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=mobile&platform=ios)
  - [Android](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/afterpay-clearpay/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=mobile&platform=android)
  - [React Native](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/afterpay-clearpay/accept-a-payment.md?payment-ui=mobile&platform=react-native)
